## Before any UI change

1. Identify page archetype and canonical nav home.
2. Open applicable rule files + full source docs.
3. Reuse shared components and design tokens.
4. Implement all states: loading, empty, error, partial, success.
5. Verify keyboard, focus, responsive, and a11y requirements.

## Master principle (from governance)

> Transovo must be developed as **one coherent product system**, not a collection of individually designed pages.
